# V0.app Integration Rules - October 2025

## 🚀 PRIORITY #1: V0.app FIRST for All Component Generation

**CRITICAL RULE**: ALWAYS use V0.app before manual coding for component generation.

### When to Use V0.app
- ✅ Creating ANY new React component
- ✅ Building property cards and listings
- ✅ Generating forms and lead capture
- ✅ Creating hero sections and layouts
- ✅ Building market analysis components
- ✅ Generating SEO-optimized content
- ✅ Creating responsive UI components
- ✅ ALL page updates and enhancements

### V0.app October 2025 Features

#### 1. AI-Powered Natural Language Generation
- Use plain English to describe components
- V0 generates production-ready code
- Iteratively refine through conversation

#### 2. Design Mode - Visual Adjustments
- Real-time visual tweaks
